{
  "id": "factory",
  "name": "Orchestra factory (measured)",
  "description": "The tickets of a real Orchestra software factory (project orchestra-automata), counted by state. There are no flows and no machines: the stocks are measured, every tick by the tickets sensor and, for the past, by the history program, which replays the factory's event log in 15-minute steps. Import the history, then use Discover flows to see which transitions between states the levels alone reveal. See factory/FINDINGS.md for how that went.",
